update settings
set value = $profile${"description":"Mandara Spa (Maldives) Private Limited (also written Mandara Spa (Maldives) Pvt Ltd, or Mandara Spa Maldives Pvt Ltd), company no. C-0321/2000, develops and operates spas and related retail in Maldives hotels and resorts, and provides spa treatments, under the Mandara, Chavana, Wellness by Mandara and Thari by Mandara brands. The company was registered in 2000 and has been in this business in the Maldives for about 20 years.\n\nTrent Munday, Director, acquired 100% of SPA Partners (South Asia) Limited, the BVI holding company that owns the operating company (99%, with the remaining 1% under a separate Maldives share sale). The seller is Mandara Spa Asia Limited, an affiliate of OneSpaWorld (OSW). The acquisition completed on 21 October 2026, when all documents were signed. The parent has exited except for licences to keep using the Mandara and Chavana brands.\n\nTen spas are open. Meliá Whale Lagoon is still under contract but closed for renovation. Madifushi and several older names are former, not current. Manhattan Grand / Hulhumalé is in negotiation. The Thulusdhoo (VISSNA) deal is not proceeding. Adaaran Select Meedhupparu and Adaaran Prestige Water Villas are the same spa, not two sites. Barceló Nasandhura is a city hotel in Malé, not a resort island.\n\nStaff rarely say \"Mandara\". A short resort name, \"we\" or \"our\", or spa, treatment, retail or contract language usually means this company. If the answer is not in company records, say so and offer a web search. Do not invent prices, menus, fees, or contract terms. Do not quote salaries, staff IDs, phone numbers, emails, or commercial terms such as fees, deposits, or revenue shares.","spas":[{"name":"Chavana Spa at Cinnamon Dhonveli Maldives","status":"open","aliases":["Dhonveli","Donveli","Don Veli","MDV05","Cinnamon Dhonveli"]},{"name":"Mandara Spa at Cinnamon Hakuraa Huraa Maldives","status":"open","aliases":["Hakuraa Huraa","Hakuraa","Hakura","Hakura Huraa","MDV06"]},{"name":"Chavana Spa at Ellaidhoo Maldives by Cinnamon","status":"open","aliases":["Ellaidhoo","Ellaidoo","Elaidhoo","Elai Dhoo","MDV11"]},{"name":"Mandara Spa at Cinnamon Velifushi Maldives","status":"open","aliases":["Velifushi","Veli Fushi","MDV16"]},{"name":"Mandara Spa at Adaaran Select Meedhupparu","status":"open","aliases":["Meedhupparu","Meedhu","Meedhuparu","Meedupparu","Adaaran Prestige Water Villas","Prestige Water Villas","MDV08","Adiran","Adaran"]},{"name":"Chavana Spa at Adaaran Club Rannalhi","status":"open","aliases":["Rannalhi","Rannalhee","Ranhalhi","MDV07"]},{"name":"Mandara Spa at Adaaran Select Hudhuranfushi","status":"open","aliases":["Hudhuranfushi","Hudhuran","Hudhuran Fushi","Hooterun Fushi","Hoothuranfushi","Lhohifushi","MDV10"]},{"name":"Mandara Spa at Adaaran Prestige Vadoo","status":"open","aliases":["Vadoo","Vado","Vaadhoo","Vadhoo","MDV12"]},{"name":"Thari Spa by Mandara at NOOE Maldives Kunaavashi","status":"open","aliases":["Thari","Th.ari","Th*Ari","NOOE","Nooe","Noe","Kunaavashi","Kunavashi","MDV19","La Vie","LAVIE"]},{"name":"Wellness by Mandara at Barceló Nasandhura Malé","status":"open","aliases":["Nasandhura","Nashandura","Barcelo","Barceló","BNM","Nasandhura Male"]},{"name":"Wellness by Mandara at Meliá Whale Lagoon Maldives","status":"closed","aliases":["Melia Whale Lagoon","Whale Lagoon","Barcelo Whale Lagoon","MDV20","Melia"]},{"name":"Madifushi Private Island","status":"former","aliases":["Madifushi","MDV18","Heal Me"]},{"name":"Atmosphere Kanifushi","status":"former","aliases":["Kanifushi","MDV09","Akiri Spa","Akiri","Essens Wellness"]},{"name":"Pearl Sands of Maldives","status":"former","aliases":["PearlSands","Pearl Sands","Huraa","MDV13","Chavanaspa PearlSand"]},{"name":"Lily Beach Resort","status":"former","aliases":["Lily Beach","Tamara Spa"]},{"name":"Club Med Kani","status":"former","aliases":["Kani","MDV01"]},{"name":"Club Med Finolhu","status":"former","aliases":["Finolhu","MDV15"]},{"name":"Hulhule Island Hotel","status":"former","aliases":["Hulhule","MDV17"]},{"name":"Manhattan Grand, Hulhumalé","status":"negotiation","aliases":["Hulhumale","Hulamale","Manhattan Hulhumale","Manhattan Grand"]},{"name":"Thulusdhoo","status":"declined","aliases":["VISSNA","Visana"]}],"people":[{"name":"Trent Munday","role":"Director, Mandara Spa (Maldives) Pvt Ltd, and owner of SPA Partners (South Asia) Limited since the acquisition completed on 21 October 2026. Previously SVP of the region for the parent.","aliases":[]},{"name":"Tenille Jade Keats","role":"Country Manager Maldives","aliases":["Tenille"]},{"name":"Benjamin James Keats","role":"Operations Manager Maldives. Oversees the Mandara and Chavana spas and liaison with host hotels. HR file also says Operation Manager.","aliases":["Ben"]},{"name":"Rosanna Bueno-Besaga","role":"Office and Administration Manager. Staff list also says Office Manager.","aliases":["Anna"]},{"name":"Luh Juniati","role":"Training Manager","aliases":["Juni","Juniati"]},{"name":"Sanjaya","role":"Accountant at Charter House (CHPL). Prepares accounts and processes payroll payments. Surname is not on file.","aliases":[]},{"name":"Hisham Fawzy","role":"Owner of Charter House. Spelling is Fawzy, not Fawzi.","aliases":["Fawzy"]},{"name":"Jessel R. Cantor","role":"Former Country Manager. Now a commission-based business introducer, not an employee, and now at Arriva. Spelling is Jessel, never Giselle or Jaycee.","aliases":["Jessel","JC","Giselle","Jaycee"]}],"contacts":[{"name":"Badhiya Gunatilake","role":"Area VP, Adaaran Resorts. November 2026 briefs also describe him as Vice President / Chief Operating Officer, Maldivian Hotels Segment, Aitken Spence (Adaaran COO since 2018). Spelling is Badhiya, not Bandia.","organisation":"Adaaran / Aitken Spence","aliases":["Badhiya","Bandia"]},{"name":"Sanjeeva","role":"Group or Area General Manager, Cinnamon Resorts, and also recorded as General Manager of Cinnamon Velifushi. Surname is not on file.","organisation":"Cinnamon","aliases":[]},{"name":"Suresh Athukorala","role":"General Manager","organisation":"Adaaran Select Meedhupparu","aliases":[]},{"name":"Lucas Chanter","role":"General Manager, in post from mid-October 2026","organisation":"NOOE Maldives Kunaavashi","aliases":["Lucas"]},{"name":"Malitha Abeysinghe","role":"Financial controller","organisation":"NOOE Maldives Kunaavashi","aliases":[]},{"name":"Ramesh Bappoo","role":"Head of Hospitality Operations, South and South-East Asia, La Vie, from January 2026. A regional contact, not based at the property.","organisation":"La Vie","aliases":[]},{"name":"Lisa Gerosa","role":"General Manager. Signed the Meliá Whale Lagoon closure amendment on 12 August 2026.","organisation":"Meliá Whale Lagoon Maldives","aliases":[]},{"name":"Ali Nahiz","role":"Chief Operation Officer","organisation":"World of Business Pvt Ltd, Manhattan Grand (in negotiation)","aliases":[]},{"name":"Naeem","role":"Described as an owner. Manhattan Grand is in negotiation and not signed.","organisation":"Manhattan Grand","aliases":[]},{"name":"Thompey","role":"Counterpart who received the November 2026 Thulusdhoo term sheet. The deal is not proceeding.","organisation":"Thulusdhoo","aliases":["Tompe"]}],"contracts":[{"name":"Cinnamon Dhonveli","partner":"Tranquility (Private) Ltd. The contract says Mandara Spa, and the spa is operated as Chavana.","status":"signed"},{"name":"Cinnamon Hakuraa Huraa","partner":"Fantasea World Investments (Private) Ltd","status":"signed"},{"name":"Cinnamon Velifushi","partner":"Tranquility (Private) Ltd","status":"signed"},{"name":"Ellaidhoo Maldives by Cinnamon","partner":"Travel Club (Private) Ltd, under the Chavana Spa name","status":"signed"},{"name":"Adaaran Select Hudhuranfushi","partner":"ADS Resorts Private Limited. Originally Chavana, later rebranded to Mandara. Addendum dated 8 June 2026.","status":"signed"},{"name":"Adaaran Select Meedhupparu","partner":"Cowrie Investment Pvt. Ltd","status":"signed"},{"name":"Adaaran Club Rannalhi","partner":"Jetan Travel Services Company Pvt Ltd","status":"signed"},{"name":"Adaaran Prestige Vadoo","partner":"Unique Resorts Pvt Ltd","status":"signed"},{"name":"NOOE Maldives Kunaavashi","partner":"OL Investments Pvt Ltd (La Vie / LAVIE)","status":"signed"},{"name":"Barceló Nasandhura Malé","partner":"NPH Investment Pvt Ltd. Named as owner on the Ministry of Tourism list. The agreement text did not confirm the contracting party.","status":"signed"},{"name":"Meliá Whale Lagoon","partner":"ASB Hotel Properties Maldives Private Limited. Novated on 8 December 2025 from Browns Ari Resort (Pvt) Limited. August 2026 closure amendment. Previously Barceló Whale Lagoon.","status":"signed"},{"name":"Manhattan Grand, Hulhumalé","partner":"Unsigned Spa Operation Agreement","status":"draft"},{"name":"Thulusdhoo VISSNA","partner":"Preliminary term sheet only. The owner is running the spa themselves.","status":"not proceeding"},{"name":"Madifushi","partner":"No current agreement on file","status":"none"}],"keywords":["DSR","Daily Sales Report","Steiners","Steiners MSP","MSP","Steiner Leisure","MDV01","MDV05","MDV06","MDV07","MDV08","MDV09","MDV10","MDV11","MDV12","MDV13","MDV15","MDV16","MDV17","MDV18","MDV19","MDV20","treatment menu","retail products","spa menu","average check","capture rate","spa director","spa manager","manning","holding salary","service charge","work permits","FF&E","operating equipment","SPAA","SPA Operation Agreement","Licensed Spa","brand licence","Charter House","CHPL","OneSpaWorld","OSW","Mandara Spa Asia","SPA Partners","Chavana","Wellness by Mandara","Thari","Adaaran","Cinnamon","John Keells","NOOE","La Vie","Barcelo","Melia","VISSNA","Visana","Manhattan Grand","NPH Investment","ADS Resorts","ASB Hotel Properties","Browns Ari","Travel Club","Unique Resorts","promotions","occupancy","guests","payroll","visas","GOP","GOR","YTD","budget","forecast"],"adminNotes":"Still to confirm, for Admin only. Do not treat these as settled facts:\n- The exact start of trading is not confirmed. The company was registered in 2000.\n- Badhiya Gunatilake's exact title is not confirmed.\n- Sanjeeva's exact group title is not confirmed.\n- No MDV code was found for Barceló Nasandhura Malé.\n- The 1 March 2027 Meliá Whale Lagoon reopen date is from Tenille's spa-configuration sheet. The closure amendment leaves the reopen date to the owner. The resort closed from 16 / 20 August 2026. Whether Lisa Gerosa is still in post is not confirmed.\n- Malitha Abeysinghe's itinerary title is Chief of Finance, which may differ from financial controller.\n- Naeem's full name and role are not confirmed.\n- Thompey's role is not confirmed.\n- The Barceló Nasandhura agreement extract is unreadable, so the contracting-party name is not confirmed.\n- No current general manager is on file for Cinnamon Dhonveli, Cinnamon Hakuraa Huraa, Ellaidhoo, Adaaran Club Rannalhi, Adaaran Select Hudhuranfushi, Adaaran Prestige Vadoo, or Barceló Nasandhura Malé.\n- A guest-house spa near Hakuraa Huraa was discussed in late October 2026 and declined. It is not a prospect.\n- Madifushi was a Mandara spa from about 2020 to about 2025 and is now Heal\\Me. It is a leftover DSR row, not a licensed spa in the acquisition documents. Atmosphere Kanifushi was Akiri Spa and is now Essens Wellness. Pearl Sands was a Chavana spa. Lily Beach still has leftover Tamara Spa branding. Club Med Kani, Club Med Finolhu, and Hulhule Island Hotel are former."}$profile$
